#AREA Imperial HQ~
#AUTHORS SuperD~


#HELPS
-1 GNOMEHQ~
This HQ is designed for all those Gnomes out there who wish to join the Gnome
Army.  Inside you will find a safe haven for Gnomes only, as well as a healer
and some equipment.
  Last updated on March 4, 1998
~

-1 SUPERDAVE_FIREBALL~
{300Master Davatar draws back his hands, pulling in massive amounts {300}
{300}of energy!  The energy ball pulsates with fierce energy!!! {300}

{130}Master Davatar yells 'SUPER HADOKEN!!!!!'

{010}A {130}SUPER FIREBALL{10} strikes you for 253hp!!!!! {300}
{010}A {130}SUPER FIREBALL{10} strikes you for 325hp!!!!! {300}
{010}A {130}SUPER FIREBALL{10} strikes you for 350hp!!!!! {300}

~
-1 SUPERDAVE_SHORYUKEN~
{300}Master Davatar bends down to one knee, and slowly draws his fist back. {300}
{300}Suddenly, he leaps up and strikes you with his fist and knee!!!
{130}Master Davatar yells {110}'SUPER SHO RYU KEN!!!!!!'  {300}

{010}A {130}SUPER DRAGON PUNCH{110} SMACKS you for 385hp!!!!! {300}
{010}A {130}SUPER DRAGON PUNCH{110} SMACKS you for 375hp!!!!! {300}
{010}A {130}SUPER DRAGON PUNCH{110} STRIKES you for 333hp!!!!! {300}
{010}A {130}SUPER DRAGON PUNCH{110} HITS you for 200hp!!!!! {300}
{010}A {130}SUPER DRAGON PUNCH{110} KNEES you for 450hp!!!!! {300}
~
