#701
lovely maiden~
A Lovely Maiden~
A lovely Gnome maiden is here.
~
You see one of the most beautiful maidens you've ever seen in your life!
She is dressed all in white, quite fitting for a healer.
You can see the letters 'MM' embroidered into her robes,
and you get the urge to injure yourself just so she can heal you!
~
