#702
master davatarmob~
Master Davatar~
Master Davatar, the Supreme Commander of the Gnome Army is here!
~
Before you stands a very formidable looking Gnome, MUCH large and taller
than your average gnome.  He looks quite SUPER and handsome all dressed
up in his mighty battle armor. He is unarmed, except for a pair of black
hand guards and his red headband, which blows gently in wind.
~
ACT_SENTINEL|ACT_STAY_AREA|ACT_SMART|ACT_NO_ORDER|ACT_BODY|ACT_RACE|ACT_AGGRESSIVE
AFF_SANCTUARY|AFF_DETECT_INVIS|AFF_DETECT_HIDDEN|AFF_INFRARED|AFF_UNDERSTAND|AFF_TONGUES|ACT_AGGRESSIVE
1000 S
150 BODY_TORSO BODY_LEG|BODY_ARM|BODY_HAND 10d100+40000 1d500+1
1000000 RACE_GNOME
POS_STANDING POS_STANDING SEX_MALE
>speech_prog p I CHALLENGE YOU, WEENIE!~
tell $n You certainly are brave $n!  I hope this is a good fight!
mpmset self quest 0 2 3 
mpmset self quest 10 1 1
mptransfer $n 714
mpgoto 714
mpkill $n
~
>rand_prog 50~
if quest(10,1,1)
 if quest(0,2,self) == 0
  cast restore
  mpgoto 713
  mpmset self quest 10 1 0
 else
  mpmadd self quest 0 2 -1
 endif
endif
~
>fight_prog 99~
if rand(50)
   mpforce $n help SUPERDAVE_FIREBALL
   mpquiet on
   cast 'fireball' $n
   cast 'fireball' $n
   cast 'energy drain' $n
   cast 'energy drain' $n
   cast 'energy drain' $n
   mpquiet off
   mpkill $n
   break
endif
if rand(25)
   mpforce $n help SUPERDAVE_SHORYUKEN
   mpquiet on
   martial
   martial
   cast 'acid blast' $n
   cast 'acid blast' $n
   cast 'acid blast' $n
   mpquiet off
   mpkill $n
   break
endif
if rand(5)
   cast 'restore' $i
   mpkill $n
   break
endif
~
>death_prog 100~
mptransfer $n 700
tell $n You are truely a mighty warrior!  I hope we can fight again!
tell $n Go now, and challenge other warriors!
mpmset self quest 0 30 0
~
|
