#707
chai fei hung~
Fei Hung~
Captain Fei Hung stands here, surveying the area.
~
You see a very powerful looking soldier all dressed in light robes.  He is
unarmed, but looks deadly nonetheless.  He is mostly bald, except for a long
ponytail whichs hangs from the back of his head.  He notices you looking at
him, and gives you a hard stare.  You've heard stories of his legendardy
shadowless kick attack!
~
ACT_SENTINEL|ACT_STAY_AREA|ACT_SMART|ACT_NO_ORDER|ACT_BODY|ACT_RACE
