95 BODY_TORSO BODY_LEG|BODY_ARM|BODY_HAND 8d100+9000 10d10+100
100000 RACE_GNOME
POS_STANDING POS_STANDING SEX_MALE
>all_greet_prog 100~
if ispc($n)
   if race($n) == 5
  if armystatus($n) == 1
    if quest(0,1,$n) == 0
      tell $n I see you are a veteran member!
      tell $n You must go see the Commander at once!
      tell $n He is to the room in the north.
    else
      tell $n Greetings $n. Welcome the HQ.
    endif
  else
  tell $n So you wish to Join the Gnome Army eh?
  tell $n If this is so, just say 'I want to join the army!'
  endif
   endif
endif
~
>speech_prog P I want to join the army!~
tell $n GREAT!  We could use a great warrior like you!
tell $n In order for you to officially join, please type:
tell $n " ARMY JOIN <your password> "
tell $n Once you Join, go north and see the commander!
tell $n If for any reason you wanna be a wimp and resign,
tell $n Come here and type " ARMY RETIRE <your password>".
~
|  
#708
general shan~
General Shan~
General Shan is here, going over maps and battle plans.
~
Dressed all in glowing battle armor, General Shan looks like a force to be
reckoned with.  His long flowing hair almost touches the floor.  He looks
up from his maps for a moment as he notices you enter the room.
~
ACT_SENTINEL|ACT_STAY_AREA|ACT_SMART|ACT_NO_ORDER|ACT_BODY|ACT_RACE
AFF_SANCTUARY|AFF_DETECT_INVIS|AFF_DETECT_HIDDEN|AFF_INFRARED|AFF_UNDERSTAND|AFF_TONGUES
1000 S
150 BODY_TORSO BODY_LEG|BODY_ARM|BODY_HAND 8d1000+15000 10d10+500
100000 RACE_GNOME
POS_STANDING POS_STANDING SEX_MALE
>all_greet_prog 100~
if race($n) == 5
   if quest(0,1,$n) == 0
  say Welcome to the Gnome Army, $n.
  say Here is your Official Army Insignia!
  say To display your rank in the army, just type "RANKING".
  say Do not lose it, for it is the only one you'll ever get.
  say Go Now and vanquish our enemies!
  mpmset $n quest 0 1 1
  mpoload 708
  give insignia $n
   else
  say Greetings $n.
  wink $n
   endif
else 
   mpforce $n say I CHALLENGE YOU, WEENIE!
endif
~
>speech_prog p I CHALLENGE YOU, WEENIE!~
tell $n So you are here to challenge the SUPREME COMMANDER EH?
tell $n You sure are brave, I must say!
tell $n To the Arena then!
connect 0 714
mpforce $n north
connect 0 -1
~   
