An Elite Gnome Soldier patrols this area.
~
Clad fully in armor, the Elite Gnome Soldier looks out for trouble.
~
ACT_SENTINEL|ACT_STAY_AREA|ACT_SMART|ACT_NO_ORDER|ACT_BODY|ACT_RACE
AFF_SANCTUARY|AFF_DETECT_INVIS|AFF_DETECT_HIDDEN|AFF_INFRARED|AFF_UNDERSTAND|AFF_TONGUES
1000 S
95 BODY_TORSO BODY_LEG|BODY_ARM|BODY_HAND 8d100+9000 10d10+100
100000 RACE_GNOME
POS_STANDING POS_STANDING SEX_MALE
>all_greet_prog 100~
if ispc($n)
 if race($n) == 5
   if actorhasobjnum(12302)
     bow $n
     mpmset $n long King $n of the GNOME EMPIRE is here!
     shout LONG LIVE KING $n!!!!!!!!
   else
   if actorhasobjnum(12303)
     bow $n
     mpmset $n long Queen $n of the GNOME EMPIRE is here!
     shout LONG LIVE QUEEN $n!!!!!!!
   else
   if actorhasobjnum(12322)
     bow $n
     mpmset $n long Princess $n of the GNOME EMPIRE is here!
     shout ALL HAIL PRINCESS $n!!!!!  
   else
   if actorhasobjnum(12304)
     bow $n
     mpmset $n long Prince $n of the GNOME EMPIRE is here!
     shout ALL HAIL PRINCE $n!!!!!
   else
   say Welcome to the Imperial HQ.
   endif
   endif
   endif
   endif
 else
tell $n How did you get in here???
tell $n I guess you want to challenge our mighty leader! 
tell $n SO BE IT!
mpechoat $n A few guards arrive and escort you to a large office!
mptransfer $n 713
mpat 713 force $n say I CHALLENGE YOU, WEENIE!
endif
endif
~
