#709
The Blacksmith~
You instantly feel the heat as you enter the blacksmith's shop.  It's rather
dark in here, with the only light supplied by the glowing embers of the huge
furnace.  You can see the huge blacksmith slaving hard on the anvil.  As you
approach, you are surprised to see that it's a woman!  She seems to be
working hard on forging weapons and armor for the mighty gnome army.
~
